#. module: product_variant_fixed_price
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_fixed_price.field_product_template_attribute_value__fixed_price
msgid ""
"Absolute sales price for variants that include this attribute value. When "
"set (greater than zero) it replaces the default behaviour of adding the "
"template's list price and the price extra. If multiple attribute values on "
"the same variant have a fixed price, the values are summed to compute the "
"final variant price.\n"
"\n"
"When every variant of the template has a fixed price, the template's own "
"Sales Price is automatically kept in sync with the cheapest variant so the "
"e-commerce listing matches the product page."
msgstr ""
"Absolutt salgspris for varianter som inneholder denne attributtverdien. "
"Når den er satt (større enn null), erstatter den standardatferden som "
"legger sammen malens listepris og pristillegget. Hvis flere "
"attributtverdier på samme variant har en fast pris, summeres verdiene for "
"å beregne den endelige variantprisen.\n"
"\n"
"Når alle varianter av malen har en fast pris, holdes malens egen salgspris "
"automatisk synkronisert med den billigste varianten, slik at "
"netthandelsoversikten samsvarer med produktsiden."

#. module: product_variant_fixed_price
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_variant_fixed_price.field_product_template__has_priced_variants
msgid "Has Variant Fixed Prices"
msgstr "Har varianter med fast pris"

#. module: product_variant_fixed_price
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_fixed_price.field_product_template__has_priced_variants
msgid ""
"True when every variant of this template has a fixed_price (> 0) configured "
"on its attribute values. While true, the template's Sales Price (list_price) "
"is auto-synced to the cheapest variant's price and the field is shown read-"
"only on the form."
msgstr ""
"Sant når hver variant av denne malen har en fast pris (fixed_price > 0) "
"konfigurert på sine attributtverdier. Når dette er tilfelle, synkroniseres "
"malens salgspris (list_price) automatisk med den billigste variantens pris, "
"og feltet vises som skrivebeskyttet i skjemaet."

#. module: product_variant_fixed_price
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_variant_fixed_price.field_product_template_attribute_value__fixed_price
msgid "Fixed Price"
msgstr "Fast pris"

#. module: product_variant_fixed_price
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_variant_fixed_price.field_product_product__has_fixed_price
msgid "Has Fixed Variant Price"
msgstr "Har fast variantpris"

#. module: product_variant_fixed_price
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_product_variant_fixed_price
msgid "Product Variant Fixed Price"
msgstr "Produktvariant – fast pris"

#. module: product_variant_fixed_price
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_product_variant_fixed_price
msgid ""
"Set an absolute (fixed) sales price per product variant attribute value "
"instead of an extra amount added on top of the template price."
msgstr ""
"Angi en absolutt (fast) salgspris per attributtverdi for produktvarianter "
"i stedet for et tillegg på toppen av malens pris."

#. module: product_variant_fixed_price
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_fixed_price.field_product_product__fixed_price_total
msgid ""
"Sum of the fixed prices of the attribute values that compose this variant. "
"Only attribute values with fixed_price > 0 are summed; the others "
"contribute zero to this total."
msgstr ""
"Summen av de faste prisene for attributtverdiene som utgjør denne "
"varianten. Bare attributtverdier med fixed_price > 0 telles med; de andre "
"bidrar med null til totalen."

#. module: product_variant_fixed_price
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_variant_fixed_price.field_product_product__has_fixed_price
msgid ""
"Technical flag, true when at least one of the variant's attribute values "
"has a fixed price greater than zero."
msgstr ""
"Teknisk flagg; sant når minst én av variantens attributtverdier har en "
"fast pris større enn null."

#. module: product_variant_fixed_price
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_variant_fixed_price.field_product_product__fixed_price_total
msgid "Variant Fixed Price"
msgstr "Fast variantpris"
